@host = http://localhost:5084

### Happy path - 201 Created
POST {{host}}/api/orders
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "customerId": 101,
  "items": [
    { "productId": 1001, "quantity": 2 },
    { "productId": 1002, "quantity": 1 }
  ]
}

### Insufficient stock - 409 Conflict
POST {{host}}/api/orders
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "customerId": 101,
  "items": [ { "productId": 1002, "quantity": 9999 } ]
}

### Inactive product - 409 Conflict
POST {{host}}/api/orders
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "customerId": 101,
  "items": [ { "productId": 1003, "quantity": 1 } ]
}

### Unknown customer - 404 Not Found
POST {{host}}/api/orders
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "customerId": 999999,
  "items": [ { "productId": 1001, "quantity": 1 } ]
}

### Validation failure - 400 Bad Request (duplicate product, zero quantity)
POST {{host}}/api/orders
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "customerId": 101,
  "items": [
    { "productId": 1001, "quantity": 0 },
    { "productId": 1001, "quantity": 1 }
  ]
}
